{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqKDfkAbbwQYaZPyBa4tSc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Description (Foreman intake)\n2\t\n3\t## What is being built\n4\t**Gandalf** â€” a stateless top-tier (Fable 5) SKILL.md \"deep-think advisor.\" Given any artifact or effort it\n5\t(1) **diagnoses** what is going on / what matters / what is wrong (the vetted diagnose core, PROTOCOL v2),\n6\t(2) **situates** the effort in best-in-class human knowledge by commissioning researchPrime where warranted,\n7\tand (3) **looks ahead** (Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight) to surface implicit/coming problems and propose\n8\t**vetted, value-adding suggestions** â€” delivering insight that elevates the effort, not merely critique.\n9\t\n10\tThe LOCKED North Star (verbatim, user) is `NORTH-STAR.md`. The vetted research substrate (engine-verified\n11\tconverged) is `../research-advisor/{FINDINGS.md,DELIVERABLE.md}`; the Master Plan is `MASTER-PLAN.md`.\n12\t\n13\t## Core honesty properties (the spine â€” NS4)\n14\t- Every forward claim (a situate frame or an anticipation) is honestly **risk-labeled** and EARNS its tier by\n15\t  an **independent named-defeater refutation**; only the **REFUTED** is dropped; nothing unverified is asserted\n16\t  as real; no self-CORROBORATED (unverifiable â†’ researchPrime handoff).\n17\t- **Single-family ceiling = PROMISING** (GROUNDED requires a cross-family refuter) â€” a machine-checked invariant.\n18\t- It COMPOSES the diagnose core + researchPrime; it does NOT brainstorm (Jumper, a later skill that composes\n19\t  Gandalf), reimplement researchPrime, or run Crucible's multi-plan refutation engine.\n20\t\n21\t## Build architecture â€” three decoupled increments (see MASTER-PLAN.md)\n22\t- **Increment 1 (Gandalf v1, the committed shippable skill):** diagnose + situate + anticipate + honest tiered\n23\t  labeling, green on the existing trio `agent()` seam with anti-laundering as