{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Jvtx3XYsHgi2CH5SwtnBsG","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Gandalf (full deep-think advisor) â€” Implementation Plan (Crucible Stage 2 â†’ Foreman handoff)\n2\t\n3\ttest-command: node --test test/*.test.mjs\n4\t\n5\t> **v2 (Stage-2 Shark R1: 1 gated BLOCKER + 1 gated MINOR + strong singles).** RESTRUCTURED so EVERY `## Wave N`\n6\t> is autonomously Foreman-gateable by the deterministic `node --test` gate (PRINCIPLE-D). The human-feasibility,\n7\t> advisory-A/B, and external-ledger steps are moved OUT of the autonomous waves into **HALT-gated follow-on\n8\t> increments** (a non-`## Wave` section) â€” they are entered only on explicit human go / external-precondition\n9\t> presence and never carry a non-deterministic done-when. Pre-registration is split: Wave 1 freezes the\n10\t> build-time CONSTANTS (R, firing-threshold, caps); only (G,k) are power-calc-SET in the follow-on feasibility\n11\t> gate. Wave 3 split into SITUATE-compose (W3) + refutation-discipline (W4). See `run/stage2-r1.json`.\n12\t>\n13\t> North Star: `NORTH-STAR.md` (LOCKED). Master Plan: `MASTER-PLAN.md` (Shark-converged). Research substrate:\n14\t> `../research-advisor/FINDINGS.md`. Single-family substrate â†’ cross_model:false; persona = Fable 5.\n15\t\n16\t## Terminal semantics (read FIRST â€” resolves the project-DONE question)\n17\t- **Foreman's AUTONOMOUS project-DONE = Wave 8 GREEN** (all deterministic code: Gandalf v1 at Wave 7 + the\n18\t  elevation-oracle harness CODE at Wave 8). The **committed shippable milestone is Wave 7 (Gandalf v1).**\n19\t- The **HALT-gated follow-on increments H1â€“H3** (below the waves) are NOT autonomous waves: Foreman HALTs for a\n20\t  human go / an external precondition before each, and each terminates in a recorded BLOCKED/UNPROVEN state if\n21\t  its precondition is unmet. No Foreman wave has a non-deterministic or advisory done-when.\n22\t- Reserved/HALT-worthy (Foreman HALTs, never guesses): the power-calc-SET values (G,k) + the ICC feasibility\n23\t  ruling (H1), any North-Star/invariant change, the external Phase-0 commission-id ledger (H3).\n24\t\n25\t## Pre-registration â€” SPLIT into frozen constants vs power-calc-set\n26\t- **Build-time FROZEN CONSTANTS (committed in Wave 1 as `prereg-constants.json`; available to all waves):**\n27\t  refuter budget **R=3**; refuter-firing threshold = value-if-true â‰¥ HIGH OR severity â‰¥ major; commission\n28\t  depth=1; per-run spawn cap=5; a skill twice in the commission_chain â‡’ HALT.\n29\t- **POWER-CALC-SET (committed by H1's feasibility gate into `preregistration.json`, NOT before):**\n30\t  non-additivity margin **G** and oracle floor **k** (jointly set by the paired-test power calc; proposals\n31\t  Gâ‰ˆ10pp, kâ‰ˆ10 real-history fixtures, to be confirmed-or-raised); min calibration **ICCâ‰¥0.7**.\n32\t\n33\t---\n34\t\n35\t## Wave 1 â€” Schema + canary harness foundation + frozen constants (GATE-0)\n36\t**Serves:** all (the harness + constants everything is gated by). **Increment 1.**\n37\t**Done-when:** the committed typed output schema + `prereg-constants.json` (R, firing-threshold, caps) exist;\n38\tthe canary harness supports per-finding field-level + rung-gated assertions, proven by a harness meta-test;\n39\t`node --test test/*.test.mjs` exits 0.\n40\t- **Given** a finding carrying a rung + a rung-gated field, **When** the harness asserts a rung ceiling,\n41\t  **Then** a violating fixture FAILS and a conformant fixture passes.\n42\t- **Given** an empty schema-conformant advisor output, **When** the suite runs, **Then** it passes (shape,\n43\t  reasoning-before-verdict, nitpick/elevation caps).\n44\t\n45\t## Wave 2 â€” Diagnose seam (compose the vetted core)\n46\t**Serves:** NS1. **Increment 1.**\n47\t**Done-when:** the vetted diagnose core (PROTOCOL v2) is the SOLE diagnosis source; B5 passes and its\n48\tdiscriminating negative FAILS; `node --test` green.\n49\t- **Given** a diagnose finding without `gandalf_core` provenance (or re-derived inline), **When** B5 runs,\n50\t  **Then** it FAILS.\n51\t\n52\t## Wave 3 â€” SITUATE compose (abstract â†’ commission â†’ structure-map â†’ outside-view)\n53\t**Serves:** NS2. **Increment 1.**\n54\t**Done-when:** S0-abstract â†’ firing gate â†’ commission researchPrime (bare `agent()` seam) â†’ structure-map\n55\t(â‰¥2 relational correspondences, answer-first) â†’ outside-view base rate; B-ceiling passes and its negative\n56\tFAILS; same-family commission gets no independent-origin credit; `node --test` green.\n57\t- **Given** a `cross_model:false` run, **When** an elevation is stamped GROUNDED, **Then** B-ceiling FAILS\n58\t  (max achievable tier is PROMISING).\n59\t- **Given** a SITUATE finding whose facts are unverified, **When** scored, **Then** it is capped (no\n60\t  self-CORROBORATED; unverifiable â†’ needs_verification handoff).\n61\t\n62\t## Wave 4 â€” Refutation discipline (the NS4 honesty spine)\n63\t**Serves:** NS4. **Increment 1.**\n64\t**Done-when:** the INDEPENDENT named-defeater refuter for each high-value elevation; B-honesty passes and its\n65\tnegative FAILS; the bounded-refuter budget path is a NAMED canary; `node --test` green.\n66\t- **Given** an elevation whose `what_would_refute_it` is a self-rated confidence word (no named concrete\n67\t  defeater + `refutation_provenance`), **When** B-honesty runs, **Then** it FAILS / auto-downgrades.\n68\t- **Given** independent refuters requested beyond budget R (=3, from `prereg-constants.json`), **When** the cap\n69\t  is hit, **Then** a canary asserts the run HALTs (no silent drop); findings below the firing threshold ship\n70\t  SPECULATIVE with the \"no independent refutation ran\" stamp.\n71\t\n72\t## Wave 5 â€” ANTICIPATE (Oranges-lens bounded premortem)\n73\t**Serves:** NS3. **Increment 1.**\n74\t**Done-when:** a bounded premortem (subject_cardinality==1; each anticipation = a populated, well-formed\n75\t`future_state_condition` + `enabling_as